-- The two views were created by the account invent, which only exists on 192.168.3.52. This recreates them
-- unchanged, but with SQL SECURITY INVOKER: they then run with the rights of whoever reads them and no longer
-- depend on any particular MySQL account. Run on the invutility database (e.g. in MySQL Workbench as erp_user).
-- Generated from HR-APP1 / invutility.

